%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI love her. Of course I do.\d%K%P
「喜欢啊。\n那还用说么」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...I see.\d%K%P
「…是么」%K%P
If a child was going to so openly resort to an unfair\ntactic like that, it was my duty as an adult to respond\nearnestly.%K%P
孩子都已经露出了这么真挚和怯懦的一面了，\n作为大人也没有办法不诚实地回应。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI never blamed her for what happened, nor did I ever feel\nlike hating her, either. ...I had simply given up.\d%K%P
「本来就没有恨她，\n也没有讨厌她。\n…只是不再执着了」%K%P
And so, I wouldn't lie.\nI would tell her about how I felt in the most\nstraightforward way possible.%K%P
所以我没有说谎。\n用尽全力说出了真实的想法。%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\dThen... what if you learned that you didn't need to give\nup...? What if you got another chance to reclaim your\nhappiness with her?\d%K%P
「那…\n可不可以不要放弃呢？\n再一次，抓住幸福可以么？」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...I'd have to think about it.\d%K%P
「…我会好好考虑的」%K%P
%LCMitoko
%LC美都子
\d...I see.\d%K%P
「………是么」%K%P
Indeed. That would require some thought.%K%P
对，会考虑的。%K%P
Not just about myself, but Asami and Toko as well. I'd\nthink for as long as needed until I could find a solution\nthat would make everyone equally happy.%K%P
不光是我，还有麻实与都子…\n让每个人都能幸福的答案，\n我会一直去寻找。%K%P
